  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper presents a 4-qubit hybrid Quantum Attention Deep Q-Network (QADQN) for S&P 500 trading, evaluated on overlapping and non-overlapping test periods from 2019-01-16 to 2024-01-16 and 2020-01-16 to 2024-01-16. Reported QADQN results include 78.91% return, 0.82 Sharpe, 1.19 Sortino, and 19.24% max drawdown on the overlapping period, and 71.26% return, 0.77 Sharpe, 1.28 Sortino, and 19.24% max drawdown on the non-overlapping period; it outperforms Buy & Hold and DDPG on the reported metrics but does not demonstrate quantum advantage.",
